Subject: [PATCH 1659/3799] soh: rename func_800849EC ->
 Interface_SwapGiantsKnife

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: toggles the Giant's Knife between whole and broken in the equipment flags and puts the matching item on the B button.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_parameter.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/functions.h                             | 2 +-
 soh/soh/SohGui/SohMenuEnhancements.cpp              | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_parameter.c                          | 3 ++-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_GirlA/z_en_girla.c   | 2 +-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_player_actor/z_player.c | 2 +-
 5 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index 9fc46a443..c6521fbca 100644
--- a/soh/include/functions.h
+++ b/soh/include/functions.h
@@ -1067,7 +1067,7 @@ void Interface_ChangeHudVisibilityMode(u16 alphaType);
 void Interface_SetSceneRestrictions(PlayState* play);
 void Inventory_SwapAgeEquipment(void);
 void Interface_InitHorsebackArchery(PlayState* play);
-void func_800849EC(PlayState* play);
+void Interface_SwapGiantsKnife(PlayState* play);  // was func_800849EC [LLM:HIGH]
 void Interface_LoadItemIcon1(PlayState* play, u16 button);
 void Interface_LoadItemIcon2(PlayState* play, u16 button);
 void func_80084BF4(PlayState* play, u16 flag);
diff --git a/soh/soh/SohGui/SohMenuEnhancements.cpp b/soh/soh/SohGui/SohMenuEnhancements.cpp
